---
// WhyChooseUsSection.astro - Why Los Angeles Property Owners Call ER Emergency Restoration
---

<section class="why-section">
  <div class="why-container">
    <h2 class="section-title">
      Why Los Angeles Property Owners Call <span class="highlight">ER Emergency Restoration</span>
    </h2>

    <div class="cards-grid">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon-circle">
          <i class="fa-regular fa-clock"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Available 24/7</h3>
        <p class="card-desc">
          Water damage does not wait for business hours. Our team is available day or night when you need help.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon-circle">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Fast, Professional Response</h3>
        <p class="card-desc">
          We can arrive on-site within hours to assess the situation and begin the work needed to mitigate water damage.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon-circle">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Licensed and Insured</h3>
        <p class="card-desc">
          Your property is handled by a licensed and insured restoration team.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon-circle">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-house"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Full-Service Restoration</h3>
        <p class="card-desc">
          From water extraction and drying to cleanup, repair, and restoration, we provide a complete path forward.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 5 -->
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon-circle">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-comments"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Clear Communication</h3>
        <p class="card-desc">
          We explain what we find, what needs to happen next, and how the restoration process moves forward.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="why-cta">
      <a href="tel:8185756016" class="btn-primary">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i>
        Call Now for 24/7 Water Damage Help
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .why-section {
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 96px 24px;
  }

  .why-container {
    max-width: 1240px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 820px;
    text-wrap: balance;
    color: var(--er-black);
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--er-red);
  }

  .cards-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 210px), 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 52px;
  }

  .feature-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--er-red);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 40px 20px 34px;
    text-align: center;
    background: #ffffff;
    transition: transform var(--dur-fast), box-shadow var(--dur-fast);
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(230, 46, 46, 0.08);
  }

  .icon-circle {
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 3px solid var(--er-red);
    box-sizing: border-box;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: var(--er-red);
    font-size: 28px;
  }

  .card-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 19px;
    margin-top: 24px;
    color: #111111;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .card-desc {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #6B6B6B;
    margin: 10px 0 0;
  }

  .why-cta {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .why-section {
      padding: 56px 14px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 26px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .cards-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr) !important;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .feature-card {
      padding: 24px 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    /* Last card spans full width across both columns so it's not alone */
    .feature-card:last-child {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      padding: 26px 18px 22px;
    }

    .feature-card:last-child .card-desc {
      max-width: 480px;
      margin: 8px auto 0;
    }

    .icon-circle {
      width: 54px;
      height: 54px;
      border-width: 2px;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .card-title {
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-top: 14px;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }

    .card-desc {
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.45;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .why-cta {
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .why-cta a {
      font-size: 14px;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
      justify-content: center;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
  }
</style>
